<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) by Piet Mondrian</title>
<meta name="description" content="The story of Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow, 1930, a De Stijl work.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#d6261d;--blue:#1f3f99;--yellow:#f5d000;--black:#111;--white:#f7f5ef;--grey:#c9c9c4;--line:14px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--black);color:var(--black);font:400 1.05rem/1.55 Archivo,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
.grid{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:var(--line);min-height:100vh}
.cell{background:var(--white);padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem)}
.hero{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 2fr;grid-template-rows:2fr 1fr .6fr}
.hero .title{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
.hero .red{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;background:var(--red);color:var(--white);display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.hero .blue{grid-column:1;grid-row:3;background:var(--blue)}
.hero .yel{grid-column:2;grid-row:3;display:grid;grid-template-columns:3fr 1fr;gap:var(--line);padding:0;background:var(--black)}
.hero .yel div{background:var(--white)}.hero .yel div+div{background:var(--yellow)}
h1{font:400 clamp(2rem,5vw,4.2rem)/1 "Archivo Black",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h2{font:400 clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)/1.1 "Archivo Black",sans-serif;margin-bottom:.6rem}
.kicker{font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.big{font:400 clamp(3rem,9vw,8rem)/.9 "Archivo Black",sans-serif}
.facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);min-height:auto}
.facts .cell b{display:block;font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.story{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;min-height:auto}
.story .wide{grid-column:1/3}
.swatch-r{background:var(--red)}.swatch-b{background:var(--blue);color:var(--white)}.swatch-y{background:var(--yellow)}.swatch-g{background:var(--grey)}
ul.p{padding-left:1.1rem}
.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;min-height:auto}
.cta a.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:.9rem 1.4rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:4px solid var(--black)}
.cta a.btn:hover,.cta a.btn:focus-visible{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);outline:none}
footer{color:var(--grey);font-size:.8rem;padding:0 var(--line) var(--line)}
@media (max-width:760px){
 .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto 40vh 18vh}
 .hero .title{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:1}.hero .red{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:2}
 .facts,.story,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.story .wide{grid-column:1/3}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header class="grid hero" aria-label="Introduction">
 <div class="cell title">
  <p class="kicker">Piet Mondrian &middot; 1930 &middot; De Stijl</p>
  <h1>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1>
 </div>
 <div class="cell red"><p class="big" aria-hidden="true">1930</p></div>
 <div class="cell blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
 <div class="cell yel" aria-hidden="true"><div></div><div></div></div>
</header>

<section class="grid facts" aria-label="Key facts">
 <div class="cell"><b>Painter</b>Piet Mondrian (1872-1944), Dutch painter</div>
 <div class="cell swatch-y"><b>Year</b>1930</div>
 <div class="cell"><b>Medium</b>Oil on canvas</div>
 <div class="cell"><b>Collection</b>Kunsthaus Zurich</div>
</section>

<section class="grid story">
 <article class="cell wide">
